{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n為紀念首款遊戲《寶可夢 紅/綠》發售30週年，日本人氣生活雜貨品牌3COINS推出聯名系列，香港都買到了！11月20日3COINS分店和YAICHI APP 網購商城同步發售。本次系列共分3大主題，分別以《寶可夢 紅/綠》的復古懷舊風格及鮮明活潑配色為主軸，將初代人氣角色融入餐桌用品、文具雜貨之中；而最具收藏價值的第三款設計，更將初代151隻寶可夢齊聚一堂，從御三家、比卡超到伊布、耿鬼與快龍等全員以滿版圖案登場，粉絲必入手！\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510410364598406_10737695336aff1d6816c0c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510410364598406_10737695336aff1d6816c0c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510410547084279_9991851216aff1d69d0563.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510410547084279_9991851216aff1d69d0563.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510410756946400_10621191356aff1d6bde067.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510410756946400_10621191356aff1d6bde067.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510410912818029_7943382846aff1d6d8df7d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510410912818029_7943382846aff1d6d8df7d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510411142848952_10865609086aff1d6fe5028.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510411142848952_10865609086aff1d6fe5028.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510411333680760_8532328016aff1d7204404.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510411333680760_8532328016aff1d7204404.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510411538665536_15135537436aff1d73d8121.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510411538665536_15135537436aff1d73d8121.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df7PvG8jzux/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:20:28.895690+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:01:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:34:05.312703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:48.078243+00:00","content_hash":"b249308986b88da44dab301b0536320488d781df19ee41cbdfb1fb20b9140da6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}